flowchart TD
    Start((Start)) --> Form[Enter enquiry]
    Form --> Check[Rate-limit and validate]
    Check --> Valid{Valid input?}
    Valid -- No --> Errors[Return field errors]
    Errors --> End((End))
    Valid -- Yes --> Persist[Persist lead]
    Persist --> LoggedIn{Customer session?}
    LoggedIn -- Yes --> Project[Attempt linked project creation]
    LoggedIn -- No --> Notify[Attempt configured notifications]
    Project --> Notify
    Notify --> Success[Return success and lead ID]
    Success --> End
